# Market Monitor — .gitignore (Phase 4a, 2026-07-24)
# This repository is PUBLIC (D1). Everything not listed as tracked is assumed
# local-only; this file makes that assumption explicit and mechanical.

# --- Credentials: never committed (uwa §2 hard rule) -----------------------
# The canonical home for every credential is C:\_Secrets, outside this tree.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# --- Local-only working files (the untracked-local class, 4a) --------------
*command instructions.txt

# --- Generated at runtime ---------------------------------------------------
cache/
logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Reports: only the published page is tracked (D2) ----------------------
# docs/index.html is force-added by the workflow's publish step.
docs/*
!docs/index.html
